SETTING|CHOICES|LABEL|DESCRIPTION
JAVA|yes-no|Java (Temurin)|The Eclipse Temurin JDK, with JAVA_HOME set, for Java, Kotlin and Gradle or Maven builds.
GODOT|standard,dotnet|Godot|The Godot engine and editor. The dotnet build runs C# scripts and needs a .NET SDK.
PYTHON|yes-no|Python (pip, venv, headers)|Ubuntu's Python 3 with pip, venv and the headers that native packages build against.
CONTAINER_ENGINE|yes-no|Container engine inside the container|Podman with the docker CLI and compose, so databases, compose stacks and Testcontainers run inside the project. The container then runs privileged.
